{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0146-s004", "text": "Inledningsskedet av undervisningen omfattar ett läskunnighetsskede, där läs- och skrivfärdighet är viktig.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-vuxna/narration/resume-20261103T053503185409+0000-2/hb-c08-u0146-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.334421768707482, "peak": 0.316986083984375, "generation_seconds": 34.31345339794643, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0146-s005", "text": "De viktigaste läroämnena i inledningsskedet är finska eller svenska, engelska och matematik.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-vuxna/narration/resume-20261103T053503185409+0000-2/hb-c08-u0146-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.010884353741497, "peak": 0.384979248046875, "generation_seconds": 29.235784620977938, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0147-s001", "text": "I slutskedet studerar man över tio olika läroämnen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-vuxna/narration/resume-20261103T053503185409+0000-2/hb-c08-u0147-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.73687074829932, "peak": 0.233184814453125, "generation_seconds": 23.484781128820032, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0147-s002", "text": "Att fullgöra slutskedet innebär att man avlagt grundskoleexamen i Finland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-vuxna/narration/resume-20261103T053503185409+0000-2/hb-c08-u0147-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.548027210884354, "peak": 0.380401611328125, "generation_seconds": 27.5042873499915, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0147-s003", "text": "Undervisningsspråket är finska eller svenska.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-vuxna/narration/resume-20261103T053503185409+0000-2/hb-c08-u0147-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.388571428571429, "peak": 0.387939453125, "generation_seconds": 21.341392752947286, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0147-s004", "text": "Undervisningen är avgiftsfri för de studerande.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-vuxna/narration/resume-20261103T053503185409+0000-2/hb-c08-u0147-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.388571428571429, "peak": 0.251434326171875, "generation_seconds": 21.117888537002727, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0148-s001", "text": "Vem som helst som har avlagt den grundläggande utbildningens lärokurs eller en motsvarande lärokurs kan söka till en gymnasieutbildning för vuxna.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-vuxna/narration/resume-20261103T053503185409+0000-2/hb-c08-u0148-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 12.329795918367347, "peak": 0.2552490234375, "generation_seconds": 47.600048190914094, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0148-s002", "text": "Den är avsedd för i huvudsak personer över 18 år.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-vuxna/narration/resume-20261103T053503185409+0000-2/hb-c08-u0148-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.224489795918367, "peak": 0.2646484375, "generation_seconds": 22.98220554389991, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
